{"name":"Bile","hex":"#b5c306","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Bile","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A Bantu language spoken in Nigeria."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Bile"}],"entries":[{"title":"Bile","blocks":[{"text":"Bile, also known as gall, is a yellow-green fluid produced by the liver of most vertebrates that aids the digestion of lipids in the small intestine. In humans, bile is primarily composed of water, is produced continuously by the liver, and is stored and concentrated in the gallbladder. After a human eats, this stored bile is discharged into the first section of the small intestine, known as the duodenum through the ampulla of Vater in the duodenal wall."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/Cholestasis_2_high_mag.jpg/330px-Cholestasis_2_high_mag.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bile"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f4/Bile_recycling.png/330px-Bile_recycling.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f4/Bile_recycling.png/330px-Bile_recycling.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Recycling of the bile","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABile_recycling.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/26/Bile_specimen.jpg/500px-Bile_specimen.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/26/Bile_specimen.jpg/1280px-Bile_specimen.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/26/Bile_specimen.jpg/500px-Bile_specimen.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A sample of bile for medical testing.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABile_specimen.jpg"}],"sounds":{}}}